{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"screen\": \"像又遇见当初不知所措的自己，走过这一路问题还是没答案\",\n      \"source\": \"最初的问题又浮上来，却没有因此得到一个简单的答案。\",\n      \"type\": \"2\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿说的是没有得到一个简单的答案，仍保留问题可能有复杂答案的空间；屏幕稿变成了问题根本没有答案，确定程度更强。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"screen\": \"他再心动，也不愿只凭这点指望，就回去过从前那种忍让的日子；明知回去未必找得回那份亲近，心里还是忍不住想：万一能呢？\",\n      \"source\": \"明知道回去未必找得回那份亲近，他却还是忍不住想：万一能呢？他再心动，也不愿只凭这点指望，就回去过从前那种忍让的日子。\",\n      \"type\": \"7\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿是先产生回去也许能找回亲近的念头，再克制自己不凭这点指望回头；屏幕稿先出现拒绝回头的决定，之后才出现心动和期待，改变了心理过程的先后。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"screen\": \"可他不再怪自己当初离开，更不愿只为有人陪着就回头；他愿意带着想念继续过日子。想起好时候还是会心软、也怕一个人熬，却仍能决定自己怎么站立\",\n      \"source\": \"想起那些好时候，他还是会心软，也怕往后一个人熬，可他不再怪自己当初离开，更不愿只为有人陪着就回头；他愿意带着想念继续过日子。\",\n      \"type\": \"7\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿先写想起好时候后的心软和孤单担忧，再写不怪自己、不回头、带着想念继续生活；屏幕稿把心软和担忧推迟到继续生活的决定之后，改变了情绪与选择的先后关系。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "14a0bab8-cb7b-43bc-bd36-0818cf9875dd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T043632892809Z", "elapsed_seconds": 259.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T04:40:52.121007+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "24aee7b9d6920f84a534b8463fa9f568833f367cb11ad6eea40b574845dac17f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T043632892809Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "c578b67021cd098c932acf788b2b2f5092fa41518c7e7a475efee75e5be87360"}}}
